{"seconds": 42.5, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! The winning line is:\n1. **Rc1+** - forcing the king to move\n2. After Ke2 or Kd2: **R8c2+** (bringing the other rook into the attack with check)\n3. Ke3 (forced)\n4. **Re1#** - checkmate\n\nThis is a classic **double rook attack** on the exposed king. The key motif is the **fork** (Rc1+ attacks the king) combined with coordination of the two rooks to deliver mate.\n\n**Coaching note:**\nWhen your opponent's king is exposed in the center, look for checks with your rooks that also improve their positions. Here, Rc1+ drives the king forward where your second rook can join the attack with check, forcing it into a mating net. Two rooks coordinating on open files can often force mate against a centralized king\u2014watch for this pattern.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Rc1+\", \"line\": [\"Rc1+\", \"Ke2\", \"R8c2+\", \"Ke3\", \"Re1#\"], \"motifs\": [\"fork\", \"attraction\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32", "move": "Rd2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32", "move": "Rc1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PPr2PPP/3K4 b - - 1 32", "move": "Rd8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PP1r1PPP/3K4 w - - 2 33", "move": "Ke1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2pR2/p3p3/8/PP1r1PPP/4K3 b - - 3 33", "move": "Re2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2r5/5R2/4B1k1/1p2p